значительная часть граждан этих государств по окончании трудовой деятельности может столкнуться со снижением уровня жизни — для обеспечения «адекватного дохода» после ухода с рынка труда им необходимо увеличить свои общие текущие пенсионные взносы минимум на 10%, подсчитали эксперты организации.","img":"https://im2.kommersant.ru/Issues.photo2/DAILY/2026/208/KMO_206592_00157_1_t219_230547.jpg","video":null,"t":"Накопи себе сам // Будущим пенсионерам в ОЭСР рекомендовано увеличить взносы «на старость» на 10%","c":"","embed":false},{"id":"d5d552974a84","src":"CNBC","lang":"en","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/10/fossil-fosl-q3-2026-earnings.html","date":"2026-11-10T22:39:30.000Z","title":"Fossil CEO says turnaround is ahead of plan as sales return to growth","summary":"Watchmaker Fossil said Tuesday that the company is returning to profit and sales growth in the first signs of its turnaround strategy.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Fossil CEO says turnaround is ahead of plan as sales return to growth","c":"","embed":true},{"id":"7ca0059299f1","src":"CNBC","lang":"en","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/10/rivian-r2-autonomy-2027-rj-scaringe.html","date":"2026-11-10T15:11:48.000Z","title":"Rivian CEO says new R2 SUV, autonomy make 2027 an ‘inflection year’ as EV maker marks five years since IPO","summary":"Rivian CEO RJ Scaringe says 2027 will be an “inflection year” as the EV maker scales R2 and invests in autonomy.","img":"","video":null,"t":"Rivian CEO says new R2 SUV, autonomy make 2027 an ‘inflection year’ as EV maker marks five years since IPO","c":"","embed":true},{"id":"4a774672bfee","src":"CNBC","lang":"en","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/10/gm-carbravo-used-car-shoppers.html","date":"2026-11-10T13:00:01.000Z","title":"How GM is trying to talk used car shoppers into buying new vehicles","summary":"Automakers say that substantial shares of the customers walking into a dealership looking for certified used cars end up buying new. Here's how it works.","img":"